[=#mysqlclientprotocol]
= Client Protocol Flags =

The //clientprotocol// option sets which client protocol the !MySQL protocol module offers.  It defaults to 41, which is what every currently supported !MySQL/MariaDB client expects.  Set it to anything else (eg. 9) only for clients older than !MySQL 4.1.  0, or anything that isn't a number, is the same as leaving it out.  It has no effect when //handshake// is set to 9 (see [mysqlprotohandshake.html Handshake Protocol Version]).

